.claude/skills/

# Local AI-collaboration working notes. Deliberately NOT tracked.
#
# BE-W6 decided this project has no handoff document in git, on the reasoning that a
# point-in-time snapshot goes stale within hours and the next person trusts it anyway
# — which had already happened once. The durable, tracked equivalents are
# PROJECT-OVERVIEW.md (state and decisions) and docs/gotchas.md (cumulative, append
# only). Everything in here is a local working aid for whoever is at this machine.
#
# The rule is listed here rather than hidden in .git/info/exclude so the arrangement
# is visible to the next person instead of being invisible local state.
.ai-collab/
handoff.md
